dn/media/anime/cover/large/bx215639-5EOHT7y3ccV6.jpg"},"description":"Faced with wealth that could last ten lifetimes, would you dare to gamble everything? Led by Lü Dongbin and Zhongli Quan, and joined by He Xiangu, Tieguai Li, Han Xiangzi, Cao Guojiu, Lan Caihe, and Zhang Guolao, eight mortals of diverse backgrounds have inadvertently come together in the Penglai Wonderland. Some acted on impulse, others joined instantly, and they impersonate immortals, engaging in various dangerous schemes in preparation for a big heist! A long-planned \"immortality\" scam has officially begun! Beneath the guise of fake immortals lies a burning ambition for sudden wealth; within the makeshift facade lies the audacity to deceive the heavens. Little did they know that a shocking conspiracy was quietly descending upon them. Where will this farcical and fantastical journey ultimately lead?","duration":144,"endDate":{"day":18,"month":7,"year":2026},"episodes":1,"externalLinks":[{"language":null,"site":"iQIYI","type":"STREAMING","url":"https://www.iqiyi.com/v_ct0nxdn2p4.html"},{"language":null,"site":"Youku","type":"STREAMING","url":"https://v.youku.com/v_show/id_XNjU1NzcyMTQ2NA==.html"},{"language":null,"site":"Tencent Video","type":"STREAMING","url":"https://v.qq.com/x/cover/mzc00200iivbt9k/c32935j923n.html"}],"genres":["Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy"],"hashtag":null,"isLicensed":true,"meanScore":85,"nextAiringEpisode":null,"rankings":[{"allTime":false,"context":"most popular","format":"MOVIE","rank":54,"season":null,"type":"POPULAR","year":2026}],"relations":[],"season":null,"seasonYear":null,"source":"ORIGINAL","startDate":{"day":18,"month":7,"year":2026},"stats":{"scoreDistribution":[{"amount":1,"score":10},{"amount":1,"score":50},{"amount":2,"score":60},{"amount":2,"score":70},{"amount":6,"score":80},{"amount":17,"score":90},{"amount":12,"score":100}],"statusDistribution":[{"amount":11,"status":"CURRENT"},{"amount":188,"status":"PLANNING"},{"amount":65,"status":"COMPLETED"},{"amount":4,"status":"DROPPED"},{"amount":7,"status":"PAUSED"}]},"status":"FINISHED","streamingEpisodes":[],"studios":[],"synonyms":[],"title":{"english":"All Wishes Come True!","native":"八仙！","romaji":"Baxian!"},"trailer":null,"trending":0,"type":"ANIME","updatedAt":1793703783},"64384":{"al":215521,"bannerImage":null,"coverImage":{"color":"#c99350","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx215521-zbToSHspRqAN.jpg"},"description":"As heavy snow blanketed the gates, demonic cultivators launched a surprise attack, slaughtering the entire Mo Sect. The young Lu Chaoge lost his closest relatives in the tragedy. Facing certain death, he awakened to a system that defied the heavens, narrowly escaping death through water-elemental spiritual awakening, and vowed to purge the world of demons and evil. After a decade of seclusion and arduous cultivation, he remained stuck at the Initial Realm, unable to make any progress. One day, a chance opportunity reactivated the system. He set out from the mountain with his younger sister, Lu Dongli, in search of spiritual herbs to break through his cultivation barrier. Along the way, he ingeniously solved a challenge posed by a strange beast, defied the heavens to summon nine Celestial Decrees to awaken his spiritual power, and broke through five cultivation realms in succession. He even faced down a challenge from a prodigy of the Sword Sect. The once-useless sect master thus began a powerful comeback.<br><br>(Source: Yuewen, translated)","duration":10,"endDate":{"day":null,"month":null,"year":null},"episodes":40,"externalLinks":[{"language":null,"site":"YouTube","type":"STREAMING","url":"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLwJAwkKCGfFNvgCHyrZ2njyZy9UadUcBc"},{"language":null,"site":"Bilibili","type":"STREAMING","url":"https://www.bilibili.com/bangumi/media/md436901507"}],"genres":["Action","Adventure","Fantasy"],"hashtag":null,"isLicensed":true,"meanScore":66,"nextAiringEpisode":null,"rankings":[],"rela